{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_047shu_2_1_8_047_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:932cc9780790b1beca93977fb1add93b1bf97a72fc2b326e2280526e1387e97b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_8_047_02:1_8_047_02:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91e78fb4b422ec8754018d98c0c36dcf71b1840241cd9824e53a6745681d216c",
      "text": "啊，在这呢。●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_8_047_02:1_8_047_02:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6da2ea733d4a8ddc344d43aa6778d52475d5da6c6213310180fca0f928c7551f",
      "text": "今天是你生日吧？恭喜……等等，\n你干嘛露出一副那么惊讶的表情啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_8_047_02:1_8_047_02:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:623ccb443fa2655a6e63ca68e45c61996ebd328eb3e61d8f3f686086259d1c09",
      "text": "非常感谢！不，我只是以为您今天\n不会来事务所了，所以有点吃惊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_8_047_02:1_8_047_02:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:effeb32538013806d35dd3e2fcd8d7fdc3476af2488b025430551c6e7f4239e6",
      "text": "事情提早办完了嘛。\n难得的机会，就想着顺便当面来给你庆祝一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_047shu_2_1_8_047_02:1_8_047_02:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3efa956c0b5a05509245c46eca1307e4feb386f731a34413ef4526ed92098edc",
      "text": "反正接下来的日程也没什么安排了。我打算在事务所\n稍微休息会儿。你不也放松一下？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
